# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Configurable remote models:** The published remote models are the ``litellm.remote_models`` list in ``meta/services.yml``, each entry an ``alias``, the LiteLLM ``model`` string and its ``provider``, plus an optional ``context`` in tokens. An inventory replaces the list through ``applications.svc-ai-litellm.services.litellm.remote_models``, and a provider without a key slot aborts the deploy."
