# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embedded runner:** Automation executes inside the main container."
msgstr "**Ingebedde loper:** Automatisering wordt uitgevoerd in de hoofdcontainer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embedded** (``enabled: true``, ``shared: false``): a Redis sidecar rendered into the consumer’s own compose stack via ``templates/service.yml.j2``."
msgstr "**Ingebed** (``enabled: true``, ``shared: false``): a Redis zijspan weergegeven in de consument eigen compone stack via ``templates/service.yml.j2``."

