# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed**"
msgstr "**Vast**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed:** OpenProject migrations stabilized (simplified migration step; preload *CustomFieldContext* before *db:migrate*). Nextcloud LDAP config hardened and incompatible apps disabled in production. XWiki extension install hardened and one time seed ensures *Main.WebHome* exists. Matomo bootstrap fails fast on root cause. TLS and CA improvements (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* improved on Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* build prerequisites and header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* policy added. Backup and ops fixes (OnlyOffice no restart during backups; backup home and ACL tasks more reliable). Container setup hardened (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker readiness and SSH restart improvements)."
msgstr "**Vast:** OpenProject migraties gestabiliseerd (vereenvoudigde migratiestap; voorbelasting *Aangepast veldContext* voor *db:migratie*). Nextcloud LDAP config geharde en incompatibele apps uitgeschakeld in productie. XWiki uitbreiding installatie gehard en eenmalig zaad zorgt *Main.WebHome* bestaat. Matomo bootstrap faalt snel bij root oorzaak. TLS en CA verbeteringen (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* verbeterd op Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* bouwen van voorwaarden en header fallback refactored; per gebruiker *password_update* Beleid toegevoegd. Back-up en ops fixes (OnlyOffice geen herstart tijdens back-ups; back-up thuis en ACL taken betrouwbaarder). Container-opstelling gehard (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker gereedheid en SSH herstart verbeteringen)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flavor selectable:** one setting switches between Code - OSS, VSCodium and the Microsoft build."
