# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform’s OIDC endpoints from ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` and ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Sign in at ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` carries the administrator’s username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in ``litellm_usertable`` and refuses beyond that without ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."
msgstr "**Inloggen als sleutelhanger:** Met Keycloak bij de inzet, de rol bepaalt ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` en de LiteLLM Gateway leest de OIDC eindpunten van het platform ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` en ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Aanmelden bij ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` draagt de gebruikersnaam van de beheerder. LitelLM dient SSO voor maximaal vijf rekeningen in ``litellm_usertable`` en weigert verder zonder ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
