msgstr "**Multi-Serverbeheer:** Meerdere verbinden en toedienen PostgreSQL instanties van één interface."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mutating commands that stay inside `allowWrite`** (e.g. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, though builds still route through `ask`) just work under the sandbox."
msgstr "**Gemuteerde commando's die binnen blijven `allowWrite`** (bv. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, hoewel bouwt nog steeds route door `ask`) Werk gewoon onder de zandbak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
