# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr "**`deny`** (voorrang 1): structureel destructieve vormen worden rechtstreeks geblokkeerd, zelfs wanneer zandbak. Omvat shell loops (`for`'`while`'`until`)Cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean/amend, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, bevoorrecht `gh` werkwoorden (`secret`'`ssh-key`'`gpg-key`'`variable`'`extension`'`workflow enable`'`workflow disable`'`repo delete`'`pr merge`'`issue transfer`), en muteren `gh api` werkwoorden (`DELETE`'`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paden)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
