msgid "**gVisor runtime:** The pinned ``runsc`` release is fetched to ``/usr/local/bin/runsc`` and verified against its published SHA-512 checksum. The Kata shim is taken from the host as it is; the role does not install it."
msgstr "**gVisor runtime:** De gepinde ``runsc`` release is opgehaald naar ``/usr/local/bin/runsc`` en geverifieerd tegen de gepubliceerde SHA-512 Controlesom. De Kata shim wordt genomen van de gastheer zoals het is; de rol niet installeren."

