# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Stuursondes (biber geweigerd op Prometheus, Bijbel geweigerd op matomo, dashboard tegel bereikbaarheid) maken GEEN deel uit van de per-role biber persona. Ze leven in de provider's eigen spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), eenmaal geparametriseerd over de aanbieder `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. Voor het dashboard, de geparametriseerde scenario gedelegeerden aan `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, die eigenaar is van de tegel zichtbaarheid / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out beweringen in een SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Cross-service sondes maken GEEN deel uit van de per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tegel bereikbaarheid is eigendom van `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, die het per doelorgaan aan de `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tegel zichtbaar → klik belastingen in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" de knop insluit in een nieuw browsertabblad). Die helper is de SPOT voor dashboard-tegel mechanica; de specificaties van de consument MAG GEEN van deze beweringen uitvoeren. Prometheus admin-reach en scrape pariteit zijn eigendom van `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach en tracker aanwezigheid zijn eigendom van `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Elke aanbieder parametreert de bewering over zijn `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Cross-service oppervlakte beweringen (dashboardtegel bereikbaarheid, prometheus admin-reach en scrape pariteit, matomo admin-reach en tracker aanwezigheid, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) zij zijn eigendom van de eigen spec van de aanbieder. Elke aanbieder parametreert de bewering over zijn `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, weergegeven via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Personen van consumentenrollen mogen deze sondes NIET dupliceren."

