# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If container or security setup behaves differently than on Linux, the WSL2 guide covers the usual [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), and [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)-related workarounds."
msgstr "Als container of security setup zich anders gedraagt dan op Linux, de WSL2 gids dekt de gebruikelijke [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), en [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)- gerelateerde oplossingen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If disk space is tight, you SHOULD move Docker data, caches, and your working directory to the SSD."
msgstr "Als de schijfruimte krap is, moet je Docker-gegevens, caches en je werkmap naar de SSD verplaatsen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If inventory_file is provided, also removes the provider role for each service from the inventory (devices.yml)."
msgstr "Als inventory_file wordt geleverd, verwijdert ook de dienstverrichter rol voor elke dienst uit de inventaris (devices.yml)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
