msgid "If the **swarm** step failed, the cluster is left up (fail-fast skips the release). Inspect it with `make swarm-exec node=<app>-swarm-mgr-01 cmd='...'` or `make swarm-shell name=<app>` per the [Swarm Loop](swarm.md), confirm the fix on the live cluster, then re-run. Release it manually with `make swarm-down name=<app>` when done."
msgstr "Indien de **zwerm** stap mislukt, het cluster is linksboven (fail-fast slaat de release over). Controleer het met `make swarm-exec node=<app>-swarm-mgr-01 cmd='...'` of `make swarm-shell name=<app>` per [Zwermlus](swarm.md), bevestig de vaststelling op de live cluster, dan opnieuw uitvoeren. Laat het handmatig los met `make swarm-down name=<app>` Wanneer klaar."

# translated-by: libretranslate
